t="44" rx="10" fill="#8FA67E" fill-opacity="0.12" stroke="#8FA67E"/><text x="581.0" y="411" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Inter" font-weight="600" font-size="12.5" fill="#EDEBE4">Teams &amp; business</text><path d="M436.3 356.3 L482 406" stroke="#8FA67E" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#ag)"/><text x="122" y="22" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Inter" font-size="11" letter-spacing="2" fill="#9aa39b">WAYS IN</text><text x="581" y="80" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Inter" font-size="11" letter-spacing="2" fill="#8FA67E">WAYS UP</text></svg></div>
    <div class="grid2" style="margin-top:28px">
      <div class="card"><h3>Events feed the year</h3><p>A weekend or group day is a powerful start, but no one can walk eleven chambers in two days. Every event closes with an invitation into membership, so the work continues at each person's own pace.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><h3>Members become clients</h3><p>One-on-one, groups and team coaching grow out of members who want more. The warmest client is someone already doing the work.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="revenue">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">The plan · how revenue works</p>
    <h2>Recurring by design.</h2>
    <p class="lede">Once a key is written and filmed, serving the five-hundredth member costs almost nothing more than serving the fifth. That is why membership behaves like cash flow: the work is done once, and it keeps giving.</p>
    <div style="overflow-x:auto;margin-top:32px"><table>
      <tr><th>Offer</th><th>Price</th><th>What it is</th></tr>
      <tr><td><b>The free Vault Key</b></td><td>Free</td><td>A first key by email. The front door.</td></tr>
      <tr><td><b>Membership</b></td><td>$99 a month or $990 a year</td><td>The full year of keys, the app, and a monthly live call with Russ</td></tr>
      <tr><td><b>Teen Path</b></td><td>$49 a month</td><td>A curated year for ages 13 to 17, bought by a parent, with virtual teen calls</td></tr>
      <tr><td><b>Family plan</b></td><td>About $129 a month</td><td>A parent and a teen walking parallel paths</td></tr>
      <tr><td><b>Groups</b></td><td>$200 per person a month</td><td>Groups of five to ten, twice a month</td></tr>
      <tr><td><b>One-on-one</b></td><td>$999 a month</td><td>Three private sessions a month, membership included</td></tr>
      <tr><td><b>Teams, families, business</b></td><td>Built to fit</td><td>Groups who walk the year together</td></tr>
    </table></div>
    <div class="grid3" style="margin-top:28px">
      <div class="card"><h3 style="color:var(--past)">Pays monthly</h3><p>Members renew automatically. Annual members pay up front and stay the year.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><h3 style="color:var(--now)">Grows quietly</h3><p>Each new member adds to the base. Revenue builds month on month.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><h3 style="color:var(--fut)">Lifts everything</h3><p>Groups, one-on-one and teams are fed by the membership.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

